    "updated_at": "2016-06-09T19:44:15Z",
    "body": "I think that would be fairly simple to implement in Gecko too, for what it's worth.  Especially if we make it clear that we mean inheritance in terms of the IDL, not whatever the proto chain happens to look like at the point when `define` is called.\n",
