    "created_at": "2016-06-09T20:09:57Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-06-09T20:09:57Z",
    "body": "I'm unclear why this is needed.  You can give all sorts of inappropriate functions to the callback argument, that won't do anything useful. Why do we need to special-case this in particular?\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
