    "created_at": "2016-06-09T21:57:35Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-06-09T21:57:35Z",
    "body": "Yeah, disallowing all `Element` and its builtin subclasses seem like a good check to have.  We can rely on the brand check for other types such as `Set` and `Range`.\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
