    "created_at": "2016-06-14T08:20:50Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-06-14T08:20:50Z",
    "body": "I don't think this is particularly high value. Depending on what your definition of \"instance of\" is, you can already create all kinds of weird objects that are instanceof built-ins by manipulating prototypes.\n\nThat said I am pretty confident that Blink _can_ implement these checks, so we will implement them.\n",
